{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:44d39ef0c7176314ed5ee0768a5d86cb2c03be52bc0939f7a22ae031ca0749d9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7421510d4e1e91eee16b88cac9559141c39a5716c8a587a951d7406dc6814d7a",
      "text": "喵呼呼……制作人君，\n稍微借一步到这边来喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43d3c6fba2a390611692f44454ed61c5a94943c96d930f78af693e4101b1ce86",
      "text": "好的，请问有什么事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a626b0f9b2fed340d20d1ad74124bbab50f1308122d73a838f0ca24861548cd",
      "text": "当当——！给制作人君的，\n白色情人节回礼喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52b4ab799a3a80e9deb7e61542e003ff8ce81465051d231ee9a774ac163b6e28",
      "text": "这是在下从至今为止吃过的无数点心里，\n严选出来的珍藏佳品喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d72e2e8c91fb313c1d416a00be6a4a1e286beacf1e40221c008c8da06e88d329",
      "text": "来来，请务必收下喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e041dcf311c41fa7c3ac522f0919559618ada5d873b091f4824fc1b0f6e862ee",
      "text": "非常感谢，桐生先生。\n看起来非常好吃呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13fbfa3b40ae9c95706d5082d683594aad8d5ade257a3f486f5568a222819bb5",
      "text": "那么重新道谢……制作人君，\n一直以来多谢你啦喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5184a927c64f65907775661030a56007b4485dba9adf7ac34db3d6f57a7c350f",
      "text": "这可是满～满倾注了在下的\n感激之情的一品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:238362088f3cb34ff5406bf81d75280f6b758d2d1f94de1c9d6df2e12bbf103d",
      "text": "累了的时候就吃点甜～甜的点心，\n咻咻咻地把元气恢复过来喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_017_23_5_02_017_23:5_02_017_23:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fc008c3575246d008cedcb45ee4daf083c02edbf0141cfb2d334ed87317018f",
      "text": "我才该说，平时一直都非常感谢你。\n我会珍惜着品尝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
